# Store and check out every file BYTE-EXACT, with no line-ending conversion on any platform (plan §12.30/§12.31).
# Evaluation sets, frozen code copies and their FREEZE.json / DATA-FREEZE.json are pinned by SHA-256 of their exact
# bytes, and several tests compare raw file content. The working tree mixes LF and CRLF files; a conversion in either
# direction (core.autocrlf, eol=lf) changed 751 files in a fresh Windows clone and broke 16 test files.
# `-text` disables end-of-line conversion on check-in and checkout, overriding core.autocrlf. Keep this the only rule.
* -text
